  "visual": null,
  "concept": [
    {
      "heading": "① 剩下的 $x$ 用 $u$ 表示",
      "body": [
        "令 $u=x+1$，$du=dx$：$\\displaystyle\\int x\\sqrt u\\,du$ 還剩一個 $x$",
        "之前說「剩 $x$ 就行不通」，但這個 $x$ 可以用 $u$ 寫出來：",
        "定積分：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^3x\\sqrt{x+1}\\,dx$，$u$ 從 $1$ 到 $4$",
        "$\\big(\\frac{64}5-\\frac{16}3\\big)-\\big(\\frac25-\\frac23\\big)=\\frac{112}{15}+\\frac4{15}$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int x\\sqrt{x+1}\\,dx",
        "u=x+1\\ \\Rightarrow\\ x=u-1",
        "\\int(u-1)\\sqrt u\\,du=\\int\\big(u^{3/2}-u^{1/2}\\big)\\,du",
        "\\begin{aligned}&=\\frac25u^{5/2}-\\frac23u^{3/2}+C\\\\&=\\frac25(x+1)^{5/2}-\\frac23(x+1)^{3/2}+C\\end{aligned}",
        "\\Big[\\tfrac25u^{5/2}-\\tfrac23u^{3/2}\\Big]_1^4=\\frac{116}{15}"
      ]
