      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int\\big(u^{1/2}-4u^{-1/2}\\big)\\,du=\\frac23u^{3/2}-8u^{1/2}+C",
        "=\\frac23(x+4)^{3/2}-8\\sqrt{x+4}+C"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 令 $u$ 等於整個根號",
      "body": [
        "令 $u=\\sqrt x$：$x=u^2$，$dx=2u\\,du$",
        "從 $x=u^2$ 對 $u$ 微分：$\\frac{dx}{du}=2u$",
        "分子比分母：拆成 $1-\\dfrac{1}{1+u^2}$",
        "$\\sqrt{ax+b}$ 一樣：令 $u=\\sqrt{ax+b}$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int\\frac{\\sqrt x}{1+x}\\,dx",
        "\\int\\frac{u}{1+u^2}\\cdot2u\\,du=2\\int\\frac{u^2}{1+u^2}\\,du",
        "2\\int\\Big(1-\\frac1{1+u^2}\\Big)du=2u-2\\arctan u+C",
        "\\int\\frac{\\sqrt x}{1+x}\\,dx=2\\sqrt x-2\\arctan\\sqrt x+C",
        "x=\\frac{u^2-b}{a},\\qquad dx=\\frac{2u}{a}\\,du"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 試一題",
      "body": [
        "令 $u=$ 整個根號的好處：根號消失，剩下有理函數",
        "代價：$dx$ 要跟著換成 $2u\\,du$，不能只換根號"
      ]
